The '''1990 United States Senate election in Texas''' was held on November 6, 1990. Incumbent [[Republican Party (United States)|Republican]] U.S. Senator [[Phil Gramm]] won election to a second term.

== Republican primary ==

=== Candidates ===
'''Nominee'''
* [[Phil Gramm]], incumbent U.S. Senator

